          "settings": {
            "title": "How We Safeguard Information",
            "text": "<p>We implement the following measures to protect your privacy:</p><ul><li><h3>SSL Encryption</h3></li></ul><p><br/>All sensitive data is transmitted with Secure Socket Layer (SSL) encryption</p><ul><li><h3>Restrict Access</h3></li></ul><p><br/>Access to our database is limited to authorized personnel only, and all activities are governed by confidentiality agreements</p>"
